/**************************************************************************
 *
 *  File name  :  lang_it.rc
 *
 *  Description:  Italian language resource tables (namespace +50000).
 *		  Pure ASCII text (no accented characters), resource ids
 *		  are the base ids from main.h/dlg.h shifted by
 *		  LANG_BASE_IT (50000) so a single executable can carry
 *		  all six languages.
 *
 *		  This file is rcinclude'd from main.rc, so it must
 *		  not re-include OS2.H/MAIN.H/DLG.H by itself.
 *
 *  Concepts   :  multilingual single-executable resources
 *
 ***********************************************************************/

